  "items": [
    {
      "type": 1,
      "content": {
        "json": "**NOTE**: This data connector depends on a parser based on Kusto Function **NGINXHTTPServer** to work as expected. [Follow steps to get this Kusto Function](https://aka.ms/sentinel-NGINXHTTP-parser)"
